  {
   "id": "card-4222",
   "name": "Introduction",
   "number": 2,
   "layers": [
    "bkgnd-2619"
   ],
   "image": "assets/card-4222.png",
   "objects": [],
   "layer_text": {
    "bkgnd-2619/field-24": "Introduction\r\rWelcome to HyperCard!\r\rThe HyperCard Player comes already installed on your computer’s hard disk. This introduction shows you what you can do with the HyperCard Player.\r\r\r\r\rTo continue, choose the next topic by clicking the “HyperCard” button to the left — or click this button:",
    "bkgnd-2619/field-26": "Introduction\r\rWelcome to HyperCard!\r\rThis introduction shows you what you can do with HyperCard. \r\r\r\r\r\rTo continue, choose the next topic by clicking the “HyperCard” button to the left — or click this button:"
   },
   "script": null,
   "grid": null
  },
  {
   "id": "card-4745",
   "name": "HyperCard",
   "number": 3,
   "layers": [
    "bkgnd-2619"
   ],
   "image": "assets/card-4745.png",
   "objects": [],
   "layer_text": {
    "bkgnd-2619/field-24": "What is HyperCard?\r\rHyperCard is an application program you use with interactive documents called “stacks.” The version of HyperCard that comes with your computer is called the HyperCard Player. You use the HyperCard Player to work with stacks created with other versions of HyperCard.\r\rYou’re using a HyperCard stack right now.",
    "bkgnd-2619/field-25": "\rThe HyperCard Icon                         A Stack Icon",
    "bkgnd-2619/field-26": "What is HyperCard?\r\rHyperCard is an application program you use with interactive documents called “stacks.”  You can use HyperCard to create your own stacks or to browse stacks created by others.\r\rYou’re using a HyperCard stack right now."
   },
   "script": null,
   "grid": null
  },
  {
   "id": "card-4950",
   "name": "Stacks",
   "number": 4,
   "layers": [
    "bkgnd-2619"
   ],
   "image": "assets/card-4950.png",
   "objects": [],
   "layer_text": {
    "bkgnd-2619/field-24": "What are Stacks?\r\rHyperCard stacks are documents you can interact with. You can get stacks designed to balance your checkbook, play games, organize information, show animated movies, and many other things. \r\rStacks are made up of cards. Each “page” of a stack is a card. Stacks can contain any number of cards. This stack contains ten cards — one card for each of the topics listed to the left. \r",
    "bkgnd-2619/field-25": "Stacks let you move among cards:                                                     \r",
    "bkgnd-2619/field-26": "What are Stacks?\r\rHyperCard stacks are documents you can interact with. You can get stacks designed to balance your checkbook, play games, organize information, show animated movies, and many other things. \r\rStacks are made up of cards. Each “page” of a stack is a card. Stacks can contain any number of cards. This stack contains ten cards — one card for each of the topics listed to the left. \r"
   },
   "script": null,
   "grid": null
  },
  {
   "id": "card-5244",
   "name": "Cards",
   "number": 5,
   "layers": [
    "bkgnd-2619"
   ],
   "image": "assets/card-5244.png",
   "objects": [],
   "layer_text": {
